keywords:
  - cardinality estimation
  - query optimization
  - DataFusion
  - DuckDB
  - Polars
  - embedded analytics
  - LpBound
  - TabPFN
  - feedback-driven
  - Iceberg Puffin
  - HyperLogLog
  - Bloom filter
  - Count-Min Sketch
